  "method": "Each later public proof calls a separate private theorem on the concrete archive record. The private theorem has a free target record and an equality from the typed payload to this target. It first proves an explicit typed-payload witness by the successful isolated annotated-delta proof. It then eliminates the equality on the arbitrary target and returns the witness. Its body and its binders contain no occurrence of the closed archive. The public application substitutes its actual archive record into a proposition identical to the original public goal.",
